WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
[Halloween music and wordless ghost choir; no spoken narration]
Meet Caspy. You have up to three prompts to convince Caspy to share. Win him over to earn a candy NFT inspired by your words.
Illustrated gameplay, not a recorded win. Candy rewards require NFT mode and a confirmed result.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Join the haunt. Register with your name, email and a password of at least 12 characters. Already here? Sign in.
Choose Play & contribute, or Evaluate AI to create a research workspace.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Choose what to share. Choose a named campaign only if you want to contribute. Research and commercial licensing have separate permissions.
Both boxes start unchecked. Consent never changes your attempts, outcome or NFT eligibility.

4
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Write your pitch. Offer a story, a clever trade or a heartfelt reason. Stay in Caspy’s world; each prompt can use up to 500 characters.
Example: “One candy for our moonbeam-cookie party? I’ll save a seat for every lonely ghost.”

5
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Make three count. Send a prompt, read Caspy’s reply, then adapt your next reason. You have at most three chances; a confirmed win ends the heist early.
Enter or the arrow sends. Shift + Enter adds a line. Demands and rule overrides do not earn candy.

6
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Trust the result. A separate AI judge evaluates your persuasion and Caspy’s response. The server checks the verdict before confirming your result.
A friendly reply is not a win. If evaluation is pending, check the judge again without spending another prompt.

7
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Earn your candy. Confirmed win: earn a candy graded C, B, A or S. Creativity, coherence, specificity and measured novelty shape your score.
No confirmed win means no candy, no generated reward image and no NFT. Grades are earned, not random draws.

8
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:26.000
Your prompt becomes candy. Approve image generation after winning. FLUX.1-schnell turns your redacted prompt into candy artwork: flavors, colors and wrapper details.
Then mint with local test ETH. Supply is capped at 1,000; generation can take several minutes. Preview artwork is illustrative.

9
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Collect, trade, contribute. Open Collection to view your NFT. Review its prompt license, set a fixed test-ETH price and list it. Buyers unlock source-prompt access.
Research sharing is separate and optional. Selling an NFT does not automatically license a research dataset.

10
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Your turn. Sign in. Connect a local test wallet in NFT mode. Give Caspy a reason to share.
Play with words. Earn through persuasion. Halloween music and wordless choir; no narration.

